---Removes every Payment Required rule from the zone. Any rules the service does not own are preserved. Deleting a zone with no payment rules is a no-op. Returns the resulting (empty) rule collection.
---
---`DELETE /zones/{zone_id}/monetization/rules`
---@param input cloudflare.monetization.DeleteRuleRequest
---@return cloudflare.monetization.DeleteRuleResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_rule(input) end

---Applies a partial update to a single Payment Required rule. Only the fields present in the request body are changed; omitted fields keep their current values. Returns the full resulting rule collection.
---
---`PATCH /zones/{zone_id}/monetization/rules/{rule_id}`
---@param input cloudflare.monetization.EditRuleRequest
---@return cloudflare.monetization.EditRuleResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:edit_rule(input) end

---Returns the currently deployed Payment Required rules for a zone. A zone with no Payment Required ruleset returns 404.
---
---`GET /zones/{zone_id}/monetization/rules`
---@param input cloudflare.monetization.GetRuleRequest
---@return cloudflare.monetization.GetRuleResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:get_rule(input) end

---Removes a single Payment Required rule identified by its ID. Every other rule is preserved. Returns the resulting rule collection.
