---`DELETE /zones/{zone_id}/monetization/rules/{rule_id}`
---@param input cloudflare.monetization.RulesDeleteRuleRequest
---@return cloudflare.monetization.RulesDeleteRuleResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:rules_delete_rule(input) end

---Returns a single Payment Required rule identified by its ID.
